==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Melee Units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] or Midranged Units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] can be used to take out the enemies.

